  "sourceTitle": "Almond Paste Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Almond Paste Cookies\nBy: Andie Mitchell\nPublished: Thursday, December 3, 2009 - 12:35am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup butter\n1 (8 oz.) can almond paste\n3/4 cup sugar\n1 egg\n3 cups flour\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cream together butter, almond paste, and sugar. Add egg and mix thoroughly.  2 Gradually add flour, blending well. Form into shapes (crescent or balls). Bake at 350 degrees for 20 minutes.",
